  - useTeslaEnergySiteInfo       GET  /tesla/energy-sites/{id}/site-info      -> EnergyStore.teslaEnergySiteInfo(id)
  - useRefreshTeslaEnergySites   POST /tesla/energy-sites/refresh             -> EnergyStore.refreshTeslaEnergySites()
  - useRefreshTeslaEnergySiteInfo POST /tesla/energy-sites/{id}/site-info/refresh -> EnergyStore.refreshTeslaEnergySiteInfo(id)
  web hook names kept verbatim at the Kotlin seam: EnergyProductsPageSource.energySites /
  energySiteInfo / refreshEnergySites / refreshEnergySiteInfo (EnergyProductsPageSource.kt L37-58).

